From 322133a0a8883dfae7e5fde094a0ac6831c674a5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Artur Szafraniec <ganggg111@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 22:38:55 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 06/29] mobileshell: One UI quick settings panel from the pmOS
 port

Header with time, date and edit/power/settings buttons, the first two
quick settings as large tiles, the rest as pages of round buttons in one
card, and brightness and volume cards (3-way merge of the pmOS 6.7.5
patches onto this fork).  The brightness card uses the libdroid singleton
of this fork.  Screenshots of the shell over D-Bus (pl.s10plus.ScreenGrab),
since the compositor cannot read the hwcomposer output back.
Autolock in kscreenlockerrc decides whether the shell locks itself.

Signed-off-by: Artur Szafraniec <ganggg111@gmail.com>
