+/**
+ * Screenshots of the shell's own windows over D-Bus (pl.s10plus.ScreenGrab at
+ * /ScreenGrab), for the hwcomposer backend where the compositor cannot read
+ * the output back.  Each visible window is rendered with grabWindow() and the
+ * layer-shell windows are stacked by layer and anchors into one screen image.
